      "t": "Andrea wants to know the terms of Mathias's contract for the actor Guillaume Canet, and sends Camille to find out. Camille asks Noemie for help, while Gabriel is trying to discover who told Cecile the truth. Listen to the requests, denials and interruption in French.",
